{"unit_id":"tag:08VY:statement","translation":"在情形<REF_0001>中，模（modules）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>-模（modules），它们是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0004>，并限制为<MATH_0005>，在<MATH_0006>上。它们的差（引理<REF_0002>）是一个元素（element）<MATH_0007>，属于<MATH_0008>，其边界（boundary），在<MATH_0009>中，等于障碍（obstruction）（引理<REF_0003>），针对将<MATH_0010>提升为一个<MATH_0011>-模（module），它是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"所述模，待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"模的平坦性，待决"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"差所对应的元素，待决"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界","context":"差的边界，待决"},{"source_term":"obstruction","target_term":"障碍","context":"模的提升障碍，待决"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"提升的模，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08VY:proof","translation":"注意，<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>都限制为<MATH_0003>，在<MATH_0004>上，并且核（kernels），对应于<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>，由<MATH_0007>给出。因此，由引理<REF_0001>得到平坦性（flatness）。取边界（boundary）是有意义的，因为模（modules）的列<MATH_0008>是短正合的（short exact），由情形<REF_0002>中的假设，以及<MATH_0009>是平坦的（flat），相对于<MATH_0010>，这一事实。关于障碍类（obstruction class）的断言，是将注记<REF_0003>的结果直接转述到这一特定情形中。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"short exact","target_term":"短正合的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"obstruction class","target_term":"障碍类"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核","context":"限制映射的核，待决"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"模的性质，待决"},{"source_term":"boundary","target_term":"边界","context":"连接映射，待决"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"所述列，待决"},{"source_term":"short exact","target_term":"短正合的","context":"列的性质，待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"模的假设，待决"},{"source_term":"obstruction class","target_term":"障碍类","context":"所述障碍，待决"}],"notes":[]}
