{"unit_id":"tag:08UE:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节利用朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）研究一点形变理论（deformation theory）。我们从一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0001>开始，它是赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的增厚。记<MATH_0002>，并将底层拓扑斯（topoi）视为相同，对于<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>。此外，假设给定一个赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）<MATH_0005>、一个<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>，以及一个映射（map）<MATH_0008>，在层（sheaves）之间，这些层是<MATH_0009>-模（modules）。本节要问，能否找到问号填入下面的图（diagram）<MATH_0010>，以及解（solution）有多唯一（如果存在）。更准确地，我们寻求一个一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0011>和一个增厚的态射（morphism of thickenings）<MATH_0012>，如（<REF_0001>）中所述，其中<MATH_0013>与<MATH_0014>视为相同，使得<MATH_0015>诱导给定映射（map）<MATH_0016>。我们将称<MATH_0017>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>解（solution）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，针对（<REF_0002>）。\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism of thickenings","target_term":"增厚的态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形","context":"所用复形，待决"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论","context":"本节问题，待决"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"给定与寻求的增厚，待决"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"给定空间，待决"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"底